{{!
    @template tool_vae/situation_page

    The page of one work situation, under its title: the code of the record, the sentences of every screen, the error of a
    send, the conflict of a version, the situation that may not be written now (its message and the text given back, in
    fields that can be read and copied); then either the two forms of the vaeiste with the heading of the text, where the
    text stands and the live region of the autosave, or the reading (details, latest version, draft in progress); the way to
    the versions, the pieces and their forms or the notice that adding is closed, the error of an annotation, the
    annotations, the button "delete", the way back to the list. A textarea keeps its text as it is written.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\situation_page. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except these keys:
    * disclaimerhtml - the sentences of every screen, drawn by the template tool_vae/situation_disclaimer
    * errorhtml, noticehtml, piececlosedhtml, noteerrorhtml - notifications drawn by the renderer of the core ('' for none)
    * messagehtml - the message of a situation that may not be written: the message of the hidden record, its title escaped
      by hidden_frameworks::message() (s()), or the sentence of the closed preparation escaped by s()
    * detailsformhtml, textformhtml - the forms of the vaeiste, drawn by moodleform::render()
    * detailshtml - the details, drawn by the template tool_vae/situation_facts
    * texthtml - a text of the situation, through format_text() as plain text
    * pieceshtml - the pieces, drawn by the template tool_vae/situation_pieces
    * pieceformshtml - the forms to add a piece, drawn by the template tool_vae/situation_piece_forms ('' for none)
    * noteshtml - the annotations, drawn by the template tool_vae/notes_block
    * deletehtml - the button "delete", drawn by the renderer of the core ('' for none)

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * tool-vae-autosave (id) - the live region the module tool_vae/autosave writes in

    Context variables required for this template:
    * code - string, the code of the record
    * disclaimerhtml, errorhtml - strings
    * conflict - object or null: noticehtml, kept, reload (url, text)
    * refused - object or null: colour (danger or info), messagehtml, kept (object: intro, fields, an array of {rows, label,
      text}) or null
    * editing - object or null: detailsformhtml, heading, status, textformhtml, autosaved ('' for none)
    * reading - object or null: detailshtml, noversion (object: text) or null, latest (object: status, texthtml) or null,
      working (object: notice, texthtml) or null
    * versions - object: url, text
    * pieceshtml, pieceformshtml, piececlosedhtml, noteerrorhtml, noteshtml, deletehtml - strings
    * back - object: url, text

    Example context (json):
    {
        "code": "RNCP100",
        "disclaimerhtml": "<p class=\"small\">Nothing here is attested.</p>",
        "errorhtml": "",
        "conflict": {
            "noticehtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-danger\">Another tab saved this draft.</div>",
            "kept": "Your text is kept in the form below.",
            "reload": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/situation.php?userid=7&fiche=RNCP100&slot=1", "text": "Reload"}
        },
        "refused": {
            "colour": "danger", "messagehtml": "The preparation is closed.",
            "kept": {"intro": "Here is what you wrote.", "fields": [{"rows": 8, "label": "Text", "text": "Alone at night."}]}
        },
        "editing": {
            "detailsformhtml": "<form action=\"#\"></form>", "heading": "Text", "status": "No version yet.",
            "textformhtml": "<form action=\"#\"></form>", "autosaved": ""
        },
        "reading": {
            "detailshtml": "<div class=\"tool-vae-situation-details mb-3\"></div>",
            "noversion": null,
            "latest": {"status": "Current version: 2.", "texthtml": "<div class=\"text_to_html\">My text.</div>"},
            "working": {"notice": "A draft in progress.", "texthtml": "<div class=\"text_to_html\">More.</div>"}
        },
        "versions": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/history.php?draftid=3", "text": "Versions"},
        "pieceshtml": "<h3 class=\"h5 mt-4\">Pieces</h3>",
        "pieceformshtml": "",
        "piececlosedhtml": "",
        "noteerrorhtml": "",
        "noteshtml": "<section class=\"tool-vae-notes mt-4\"></section>",
        "deletehtml": "",
        "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/situations.php?userid=7&fiche=RNCP100", "text": "Back to the list"}
    }
}}
<p><strong>{{code}}</strong></p>{{{disclaimerhtml}}}{{{errorhtml}}}{{!
}}{{#conflict}}{{{noticehtml}}}<p>{{kept}}</p>{{#reload}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/reload}}{{/conflict}}{{!
}}{{#refused}}<div class="alert alert-{{colour}}">{{{messagehtml}}}</div>{{#kept}}<p>{{intro}}</p>{{!
}}{{#fields}}<textarea readonly="readonly" rows="{{rows}}" cols="70" class="form-control mb-3" aria-label="{{label}}">{{!
}}{{text}}</textarea>{{/fields}}{{/kept}}{{/refused}}{{!
}}{{#editing}}{{{detailsformhtml}}}<h3 class="h5 mt-4">{{heading}}</h3><p>{{status}}</p>{{{textformhtml}}}{{!
}}<div class="text-muted small" id="tool-vae-autosave" role="status" aria-live="polite">{{autosaved}}</div>{{/editing}}{{!
}}{{#reading}}{{{detailshtml}}}{{#noversion}}<p class="text-muted">{{text}}</p>{{/noversion}}{{!
}}{{#latest}}<p class="text-muted small mb-1">{{status}}</p>{{!
}}<div class="mb-2 tool-vae-situation-text">{{{texthtml}}}</div>{{/latest}}{{!
}}{{#working}}<div class="border-start ps-2 mb-2 tool-vae-situation-working"><p class="text-muted small mb-1">{{notice}}</p>{{!
}}{{{texthtml}}}</div>{{/working}}{{/reading}}{{!
}}{{#versions}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/versions}}{{{pieceshtml}}}{{{pieceformshtml}}}{{{piececlosedhtml}}}{{!
}}{{{noteerrorhtml}}}{{{noteshtml}}}{{{deletehtml}}}{{#back}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/back}}
